      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.40399932861328,
        220.98634338378906,
        212.2294921875,
        233.26034545898438
      ],
      "text": "Preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        122.20469665527344,
        263.978515625,
        217.00323486328125,
        276.2525329589844
      ],
      "text": "If become symptomatic",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        250.5222930908203,
        306.02569580078125,
        343.80853271484375,
        318.2997131347656
      ],
      "text": "Evaluate for TB disease",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.797607421875,
        369.87469482421875,
        348.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "Children must be free of any TB and non-TB related symptoms to be considered well.   a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.797607421875,
        526.2153930664062,
        358.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "The commonest TB-related symptoms are persistence of: cough, fever, not eating well/anorexia, weight loss/failure to thrive, fatigue,  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        358.46160888671875,
        526.1784057617188,
        368.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "reduced playfulness and decreased activity. If TB disease is suspected, refer to Chapter 3 in the Guidance for national tuberculosis",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        368.46160888671875,
        338.6938781738281,
        378.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "programmes on the management of tuberculosis in children. Second edition",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        378.46160888671875,
        272.7057189941406,
        388.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "(www.who.int/tb/publications/childtb_guidelines/en/).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.797607421875,
        526.221435546875,
        398.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid 10 mg/kg (7−15 mg/kg) daily for 6 months. 3-month weekly regimen of rifapentine plus isoniazid or 3-month daily  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        398.46160888671875,
        318.103515625,
        408.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin plus isoniazid may be used as an alternative (see section 5).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.797607421875,
        526.23583984375,
        418.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "If TB disease is diagnosed, anti-TB treatment should be started and the child registered with the national TB programme. If TB disease  d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        418.46160888671875,
        355.35888671875,
        428.7016296386719
      ],
      "text": "is excluded, the child should be considered for eligibility for preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.09271240234375,
        526.708251953125,
        469.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "negative people and people of unknown HIV status. The review covered 33 studies, including 17 newly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        396.8111877441406,
        471.03271484375,
        468.8621520996094,
        483.96270751953125
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.09271240234375,
        526.6760864257812,
        483.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "identified. The evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables are presented in  . To illustrate",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        485.09271240234375,
        526.7192993164062,
        497.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "how the various screening and diagnostic algorithms are expected to rule out active TB, a simple model was",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        499.09271240234375,
        526.6602172851562,
        511.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "constructed to compare the following six screening criteria: (i) any TB symptom, (ii) any cough, (iii) cough for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        513.0927124023438,
        526.6641845703125,
        525.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "> 2–3 weeks, (iv) chest radiographic abnormality suggestive of TB, (v) any chest radiographic abnormality and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        527.0927124023438,
        526.6451416015625,
        539.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "(vi) a combination of any chest radiographic abnormality or any TB symptom. The model suggested that the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        541.0927124023438,
        526.6841430664062,
        553.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "combination of any chest radiographic abnormality and the presence of any symptoms suggestive of TB (i.e.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        555.0927124023438,
        526.6922607421875,
        567.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "any cough of any duration, haemoptysis, fever, night sweats, weight loss, chest pain, shortness of breath and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        569.0927124023438,
        513.5682373046875,
        581.8927001953125
      ],
      "text": "fatigue) would offer the highest sensitivity (100%) and negative predictive value (100%) for ruling out TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        588.7026977539062,
        94.57608032226562,
        601.6326904296875
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 4",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.57608032226562,
        588.7626953125,
        524.4061279296875,
        601.5626831054688
      ],
      "text": "presents the algorithm for targeted diagnosis and treatment of LTBI and exclusion of active TB in house-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        602.7626953125,
        312.7220764160156,
        615.8726806640625
      ],
      "text": "hold contacts aged  5 years and other at-risk populations. ≥",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.7819213867188,
        402.25921630859375,
        646.285888671875
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendation on HIV-negative household contacts",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.6044921875,
        526.6892700195312,
        662.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted the lack of any new data and agreed to continue use of the existing symptom-based algorithms",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.90609741210938,
        663.5444946289062,
        98.73509216308594,
        676.4744873046875
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 3",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.6044921875,
        526.6492919921875,
        676.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "( ) for HIV-negative infants and children who are household contacts of TB cases. The GDG reiterated",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.6044921875,
        526.6739501953125,
        690.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "that active TB should be ruled out primarily by investigations, according to national guidelines. It noted that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.6044921875,
        526.6570434570312,
        704.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "screening of child contacts could include LTBI testing and chest radiography, although the absence of those",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.6044921875,
        526.6383056640625,
        718.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "investigations should not pose a barrier for either diagnosis of active TB disease or provision of preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.6044921875,
        526.611083984375,
        732.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "treatment. In the absence of these tests, clinical assessment alone is sufficient to decide on eligibility for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.6044921875,
        526.6975708007812,
        746.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment particularly for children < 5 years of age who are household contacts of a bacteriologically",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        747.6044921875,
        179.43907165527344,
        760.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "confirmed pulmonary TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
